# The runtime integrity check hashes these files byte for byte. Git on Windows
# rewrites line endings on checkout by default, which changes every hash and
# makes `npm run check:runtime` fail before the app can start. Pin LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png -text
*.jpg -text
*.jpeg -text
*.woff -text
*.woff2 -text
*.ico -text
